WEBVTT

00:00.350 --> 00:16.520
Open Operations from the Services dashboard to work in the restored ANC Operations Workspace. The full table-first workspace is embedded here, so displays, venues, walkthroughs, documents, and other operating areas stay together.

00:17.320 --> 00:27.168
When scheduling an event, open the League field and choose N F L. The new option now sits alongside the other sports classifications used across the schedule.

00:27.968 --> 00:38.495
In a Venue Profile, open Settings to add the venue logo and cover image. Both P N G and J peg files are accepted, previewed in place, and saved with the venue.

00:39.295 --> 00:51.547
Inventory Reports gives managers one review path. Complete the five-step checklist, record physical counts and condition, then submit for review. Variances and restock needs are called out automatically.

00:52.347 --> 01:04.180
Shift Scheduling supports C S V and Excel schedule imports. Preview first to match venues and staff, catch row errors or duplicates, and then add the approved shifts to the upcoming schedule.

01:04.980 --> 01:18.120
The Operations Workspace now uses ANC naming and internal navigation throughout. Staff can stay inside one connected operating surface, with no external platform branding or plan language in the way.
